WEBVTT

00:00:02.570 --> 00:00:04.260
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:06.770
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:10.040
Kukai's brothers will be here today!

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:12.170
They're all so cool!

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:13.730
Looks like things are gonna get wild!

00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:16.390
In that case, you guys'll 
need special training!

00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:18.150
You mean...

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:26.190
It's chock full of surprises, 
so keep your eyes glued to the screen!

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:27.100
Doki!

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:54.360
I'm gonna tell you a secret.

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:57.270
Don't tell <i>anyone</i>, okay?

00:00:57.270 --> 00:01:00.160
Even though I'm not girly at all,

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:02.930
two certain boys said they like me!

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.870
Jump up a bit into the sky.

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:08.750
My dearest friends are always there.

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:11.580
Even if you suddenly Character Change,

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:14.490
I'll be there to stop you with my great big heart.

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:17.360
Pinky swear!

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:19.760
Cross my heart!

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:22.970
Lucky, happy, leave it to me!

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:26.020
That'd be universal peace, but...

00:01:26.020 --> 00:01:28.770
I'll end up protectin' everyone's hearts.

00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:31.540
Let's all smile together!

00:01:31.540 --> 00:01:34.400
Lucky, happy, leave it to me!

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:37.210
That's world peace! Yeah, that!

00:01:37.510 --> 00:01:40.440
Everyone has dreams, so I'm gonna protect 'em!

00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:43.260
Make a victory sign together!

00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:13.360
If you had just listened to 
me from the beginning,

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:16.070
I wouldn't need to get so rough with you.

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:23.080
As you are now, you cannot escape from here.

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:26.200
I'll make sure my next plan is a success.

00:02:26.820 --> 00:02:32.100
You may not accept it, but do not forget that you are legally my son.

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:55.940
Episode 79
Ikuto and Amu
Sorrowful Battle!

00:02:59.010 --> 00:03:01.820
Today didn't work out, 
but there's always tomorrow...

00:03:02.290 --> 00:03:03.990
That's easy for you to say...

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:09.550
What should I actually tell him?

00:03:09.550 --> 00:03:13.850
Amu-chan, in these situations, you should 
give him a tasty treat as a gift.

00:03:13.850 --> 00:03:17.470
Once he tastes how delicious they are, 
he's sure to forgive you!

00:03:17.470 --> 00:03:20.700
You could also draw a card 
that expresses your feelings.

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:23.460
Why don't you write a song for him?

00:03:23.460 --> 00:03:26.720
I'm sorry, Tadase-kun!

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:29.240
The truth is, I love you!

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:30.240
That's not going to work.

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:32.110
In the first place, Amu-chan's 
singing is kinda-

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:33.520
Oh yeah, I forgot...

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:35.000
She should write a letter!

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:37.710
No way, she's gotta talk face-to-face!

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:40.350
Which would be better? Cookies or waffles?

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:45.220
Um, I appreciate your suggestions, 
but could you quiet down?

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:49.400
Yoru?

00:03:51.570 --> 00:03:52.560
What's the matter?

00:03:52.560 --> 00:03:54.580
But first, please calm down.

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:01.490
Ikuto... Ikuto's in big trouble-nya!

00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:03.110
He is?

00:04:03.110 --> 00:04:06.930
He's been captured by Easter's goons!

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:09.390
I can't do anything about it by myself.

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:12.020
Amu, please help us out-nya!

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:14.900
Why... should I?

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:18.190
Ikuto was acting all weird 
because of that violin-nya!

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:25.910
Whenever it glowed purple, it was like 
Ikuto was being controlled.

00:04:26.390 --> 00:04:29.100
If we don't find him fast 
and save him, then...

00:04:31.050 --> 00:04:34.670
Even though he said such 
horrible things to Tadase-kun?

00:04:35.510 --> 00:04:38.670
"Would it be okay for me to fall in love with you," was it?

00:04:39.950 --> 00:04:43.040
Quite a passionate confession for a little boy.

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:46.450
That wasn't what Ikuto really thinks-nya!

00:04:46.450 --> 00:04:48.650
I don't believe that.

00:04:49.990 --> 00:04:53.230
I'm beggin'-nya! I'm beggin'-nya! 
I'm beggin'-nya!

00:04:56.260 --> 00:04:57.490
Amu-chan...

00:04:57.490 --> 00:04:59.400
You must save him.

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:02.900
You're the only one 
who can do it, Amu-chan.

00:05:03.550 --> 00:05:05.020
Amu-chan!

00:05:05.020 --> 00:05:06.310
Amu-chan!

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:09.280
Say that all you want, but...

00:05:12.270 --> 00:05:14.560
I... I...

00:05:14.560 --> 00:05:16.620
I have a lot on my mind right now!

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:21.210
Amu-chan...

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:31.990
All I keep doing is hurting people.

00:05:32.510 --> 00:05:35.680
So what should I do?

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:39.780
I don't know. I just don't know.

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:46.270
Thank you, come again!

00:05:47.940 --> 00:05:49.950
Man, this ain't right!

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:52.260
Don't look at me. You're the one who lost 
at rock-paper-scissors, Kukai.

00:05:52.260 --> 00:05:56.100
There's something totally 
fishy about this! He must've cheated!

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:01.660
Tadase?

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:04.060
Tadase.

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:09.400
You should hurry home. You don't want your cold to come back.

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:11.480
Yeah, you're right.

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:15.010
But I'm relieved that you're feeling better.

00:06:15.010 --> 00:06:18.780
I guess you just needed to talk 
with a reliable Guardian Character.

00:06:19.610 --> 00:06:20.400
Yeah...

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:23.020
Hey. King!

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:24.430
Soma-kun.

00:06:24.870 --> 00:06:26.790
Takin' a walk this late?

00:06:26.790 --> 00:06:27.920
Yeah...

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:29.760
Were you buying groceries?

00:06:30.470 --> 00:06:33.450
I lost at rock-paper-scissors, 
so I've gotta get stuff for my brothers.

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:36.430
Oh, right. I knew you 
had older brothers.

00:06:36.430 --> 00:06:37.750
I'm a bit envious.

00:06:37.940 --> 00:06:41.750
Really? They're big, loud, 
and constantly get in my way.

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:46.380
Well, I've always wanted a big brother.

00:06:47.960 --> 00:06:50.560
Then why don't you come 
over to my place right now?

00:06:52.490 --> 00:06:54.390
Kukai's house!

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:56.430
I see. So this is a commoner's dwelling?

00:06:58.100 --> 00:06:59.310
Let me introduce everyone.

00:06:59.510 --> 00:07:01.010
The eldest brother, Kaido.

00:07:01.010 --> 00:07:01.940
Yo.

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:04.340
The second oldest, Shusui.

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:05.270
Hey.

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:07.510
The middle brother, Unkai.

00:07:07.510 --> 00:07:08.530
Who's this?

00:07:09.050 --> 00:07:10.470
The fourth brother, Rento.

00:07:10.470 --> 00:07:11.780
Nice to meet you.

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:13.970
And I'm the youngest!

00:07:13.970 --> 00:07:16.040
F-Five brothers?

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:17.750
Huh? Didn't I tell you?

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:19.610
A friend of yours, Kukai?

00:07:19.610 --> 00:07:21.720
Man, if you're gonna bring 
friends over, bring a girl.

00:07:21.720 --> 00:07:23.960
Although, he's cute in a girly way.

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:26.320
Do you pick on him, Kukai?

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:28.430
Can I pet him?

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:31.810
Just ignore them. Let's go to my room.

00:07:31.810 --> 00:07:32.790
Hold it!

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:37.390
You runt! This ain't the right magazine!

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:41.150
I asked for meat buns, 
and you got me bean paste!

00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:43.780
And you got me avocado-flavored chips instead of consommé!

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:45.100
A bonsai newspaper?

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:47.640
You think I can remember all that?

00:07:47.640 --> 00:07:49.900
Huh? You say somethin'?

00:07:50.180 --> 00:07:52.780
Or was I just hearin' things?

00:07:53.290 --> 00:07:56.550
'Cause I think I just heard you talkin' back to me!

00:07:56.550 --> 00:07:57.850
Face off!

00:07:57.850 --> 00:07:59.910
Sure, bring it on!

00:08:01.170 --> 00:08:03.340
Kick his butt, Kukai!

00:08:03.340 --> 00:08:05.060
They're really going at each other.

00:08:05.060 --> 00:08:07.170
Hey, shouldn't we stop them?

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:09.170
Nah, this is normal.

00:08:13.730 --> 00:08:14.640
Bring it!

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:19.140
Now's your last chance to back out 
if you don't wanna get hit.

00:08:27.470 --> 00:08:28.940
Soccer?

00:08:37.360 --> 00:08:39.130
He really means business!

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:41.030
You gotta feel sorry for him.

00:08:41.030 --> 00:08:43.160
So he's trying to get 
this over with quickly?

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:45.040
All right, next!

00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:55.140
You get it?

00:08:55.140 --> 00:08:57.420
I don't wanna hear no 
more back-talk outta ya.

00:08:57.420 --> 00:08:58.600
Shut up.

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:01.310
Huh? What was that?

00:09:02.370 --> 00:09:03.430
I said, "shut up."

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:08.310
Say what?!

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:16.430
Boomerang Shot!

00:09:16.430 --> 00:09:18.260
Lightning Inazuma Catch!

00:09:18.260 --> 00:09:20.460
Shining Tornado Shot!

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:22.600
Burning Galaxy Catch!

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:25.910
So his love of special training 
came from his brothers?

00:09:25.910 --> 00:09:27.920
Same goes for his naming sense.

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:31.230
You're an eyesore!

00:09:31.230 --> 00:09:32.900
You're the one that's not lettin' go!

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:35.310
Second round's a floor-mopping race!

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:38.990
I don't even know what 
they're fighting about anymore.

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:42.360
Kukai doesn't like being coddled.

00:09:43.610 --> 00:09:48.260
That's why Kaido always 
plays with him like that.

00:09:48.260 --> 00:09:50.820
It's just his way of 
showing brotherly love.

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:52.690
Though it's a tad roundabout.

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:56.570
Ow...

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:59.870
Too bad, brat.

00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:01.660
Y-You're heavy!

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:03.300
Move it, you big oaf!

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:04.610
Did I hear something?

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:06.640
What's that?

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:25.250
Ikuto always had good 
reasons for what he did.

00:10:25.250 --> 00:10:27.350
He just isn't being honest about it.

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:32.650
Even what he did back then... 
Maybe Yoru was telling the truth.

00:10:34.580 --> 00:10:37.430
Man, I'm beat.

00:10:37.430 --> 00:10:40.120
Today's special training 
was harder than usual.

00:10:40.120 --> 00:10:40.860
Yeah.

00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:44.270
What?

00:10:44.270 --> 00:10:50.390
You're like the Guardians' big brother, 
but at home you're the baby.

00:10:50.390 --> 00:10:51.560
Got you to smile, eh?

00:10:52.770 --> 00:10:55.200
Sometimes, livin' it up 
a little ain't so bad.

00:10:55.200 --> 00:10:56.550
Especially when you're feeling down.

00:10:57.700 --> 00:10:59.980
What makes you say that?

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:03.600
I wasn't the Jack's Chair 
for nothing, you know.

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:09.230
But if I had brothers like yours...

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:12.910
Didn't you used to? You know, him.

00:11:12.910 --> 00:11:16.450
You and Tsukiyomi Ikuto 
were as close as brothers.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:19.610
That's all in the past.

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:22.700
Tsukiyomi Ikuto betrayed Tadase.

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:24.620
The ultimate betrayal.

00:11:25.890 --> 00:11:26.990
Sorry.

00:11:27.300 --> 00:11:30.460
I never actually told you about it...

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:33.450
It's okay, I don't wanna 
force it out of you.

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:37.570
Back when I was young...

00:11:38.320 --> 00:11:43.640
Kaido-oniichan lost a soccer 
ball that I really loved.

00:11:44.230 --> 00:11:46.430
Of course, we got in a 
gigantic fight about it.

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:50.980
What're you talking about, Bro?! Where's my ball?

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:56.020
I threw it away, 'cause you're always 
flappin' that big mouth of yours.

00:11:56.020 --> 00:11:57.190
Got a problem?

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:02.200
I swore I'd never talk to him again.

00:12:02.650 --> 00:12:05.480
I thought I'd never forgive 
him for the rest of my life.

00:12:06.270 --> 00:12:09.650
But two weeks later, 
my birthday came around.

00:12:11.650 --> 00:12:14.390
What's this? A soccer net?

00:12:15.730 --> 00:12:20.670
I made it out of some stuff lyin' around. It's basically recycled, so don't go thinkin' I went outta my way.

00:12:21.360 --> 00:12:24.470
Now you don't have to practice 
kicking on the street.

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:30.060
My ball?

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:44.320
He seems scary, but he's just not good at expressing himself.

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:46.970
Know anyone else who never makes excuses, 
even for a misunderstanding?

00:12:46.970 --> 00:12:48.980
Who's just awkward sometimes?

00:12:55.280 --> 00:12:59.420
I'm not misunderstanding anything. I don't think.

00:13:01.690 --> 00:13:02.800
But...

00:13:03.530 --> 00:13:07.520
The Tsukiyomi Ikuto I met 
that night was different.

00:13:09.330 --> 00:13:16.860
Maybe I've hated him for so long 
I've forgotten something important.

00:13:18.490 --> 00:13:22.400
I want to protect the world 
of the people around me.

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:25.370
Even if it's just a small world...

00:13:26.260 --> 00:13:30.650
I don't want any of the 
people around me to be unhappy.

00:13:33.300 --> 00:13:38.420
And that... includes Tsukiyomi Ikuto.

00:13:42.410 --> 00:13:44.240
Hear, hear, King!

00:13:44.240 --> 00:13:46.880
That's just what I like about you!

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:47.840
Soma-kun...

00:13:49.110 --> 00:13:52.350
But you know, the King's not alone.

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:55.930
You've always got your 
faithful retainer near you.

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:57.440
You've got allies.

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:00.980
Not just me, either, 
but all of the Guardians!

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:02.320
And Guardian Characters, too!

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:03.320
Yes, yes.

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:05.650
You should rely on us sometimes!

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:06.530
'Kay?

00:14:08.060 --> 00:14:08.920
Okay!

00:14:18.910 --> 00:14:20.880
There you are, Amu-chan!

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:23.870
Man, we were looking everywhere for you.

00:14:23.870 --> 00:14:26.860
You'll catch a cold if you stay out here.

00:14:27.420 --> 00:14:29.200
I know...

00:14:29.770 --> 00:14:31.750
I know he was telling the truth.

00:14:32.440 --> 00:14:34.980
Ikuto's not to blame.

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:41.650
I am. I hid my true feelings from everyone.

00:14:42.290 --> 00:14:45.070
I didn't prepare for the consequences 
like Nagihiko told me to.

00:14:45.710 --> 00:14:50.490
I kept up those stupid lies because 
I didn't want anyone to hate me.

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:56.260
Even my mom said she wished I'd 
trusted her, instead of hiding things.

00:14:57.230 --> 00:15:01.610
I didn't have faith in Tadase-kun.

00:15:02.140 --> 00:15:05.090
And even though I'd decided 
to believe in Ikuto...

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:07.530
I ended up hurting them both.

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:11.500
All finished!

00:15:11.500 --> 00:15:14.510
All finished, all finished, all finished!

00:15:14.710 --> 00:15:16.390
Feelin' down time is all finished!

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:18.420
Let's go back to happy time now, 'kay?

00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:23.940
Yay, yay, Amu-chan! 
You can do it, Amu-chan!

00:15:24.240 --> 00:15:27.580
I've locked onto your negative heart!

00:15:27.580 --> 00:15:30.620
You've got to remember all 
the great things about yourself!

00:15:31.370 --> 00:15:35.860
The best thing about you, Amu-chan, is your 
sort of stubborn, straightforward nature!

00:15:35.860 --> 00:15:39.370
You're not honest with yourself, 
but you're kind to others.

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:41.940
Are you complimenting me or insulting me?

00:15:41.940 --> 00:15:43.250
Complimenting!

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:45.020
And um... um...

00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:46.480
Amu-chan.

00:15:46.480 --> 00:15:50.300
We love you, Amu-chan!

00:15:50.600 --> 00:15:54.930
No matter what happens, 
we'll always be on your side!

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:57.180
If you screw up, you can fix it!

00:15:57.520 --> 00:16:00.980
If you do something bad, 
you can apologize!

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:03.640
Your Guardian Characters 
will always be with you!

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:05.690
It'll be okay, promise!

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:15.050
It's from Utau.

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:17.310
The camera's so close!

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:23.560
I'm working in Okinawa right now.

00:16:24.060 --> 00:16:27.060
I'm giving my all in my own way.

00:16:27.870 --> 00:16:32.370
You have to look after 
Ikuto while I'm away, okay?

00:16:32.950 --> 00:16:34.300
As my friend.

00:16:36.440 --> 00:16:40.580
You annoy me, but you've got this strange ability.

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:44.660
People like you always end up 
helping everyone around them.

00:16:47.570 --> 00:16:49.690
I shouldn't be depressed!

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:53.770
My heart:

00:16:54.460 --> 00:16:55.910
Unlock!

00:17:14.350 --> 00:17:16.690
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:22.430
Ikuto!

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:24.910
What am I gonna do-nya?

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:27.630
Amu?

00:17:27.630 --> 00:17:28.690
I'm sorry for making you wait.

00:17:28.960 --> 00:17:31.150
Come on, let's save Ikuto.

00:17:32.560 --> 00:17:34.610
Amu!

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:43.380
Do you have any idea 
where he might be?

00:17:43.380 --> 00:17:48.130
Not one. Thanks to that violin, 
I can't sense him-nya.

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:52.130
Amu-chan, I can hear something.

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:04.360
That pizzicato!

00:18:04.360 --> 00:18:05.670
Let's go, Tadase!

00:18:05.670 --> 00:18:06.390
Right.

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:18.070
This place?

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:21.450
This is that abandoned amusement park 
you and Ikuto went to before.

00:18:24.440 --> 00:18:25.680
A violin?

00:18:25.680 --> 00:18:26.830
It's coming from over there-nya!

00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:41.800
Why are so many people here?

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:44.760
They're all missing their hearts' eggs!

00:18:44.760 --> 00:18:46.360
Ikuto!

00:18:47.140 --> 00:18:49.600
Ikuto, where are you-nya?

00:18:50.990 --> 00:18:52.110
Ikuto!

00:18:59.480 --> 00:19:00.430
Ikuto!

00:19:01.640 --> 00:19:04.080
The violin is glowing purple!

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:11.170
Ikuto?

00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:12.410
Amu-chan!

00:19:18.500 --> 00:19:19.410
Ikuto!

00:19:19.410 --> 00:19:20.550
Snap out of it-nya!

00:19:20.750 --> 00:19:22.680
Can't you hear my voice?

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:24.130
Ikuto!

00:19:34.570 --> 00:19:36.730
A black egg?

00:19:37.140 --> 00:19:39.790
My heart: Unlock.

00:20:05.770 --> 00:20:08.130
Character Transformation: Death Rebel.

00:20:10.950 --> 00:20:13.810
That's the Character Transformation I saw before!

00:20:14.160 --> 00:20:18.450
Ikuto has transformed with that black egg...

00:20:28.600 --> 00:20:29.500
Ikuto!

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:39.640
The amusement park will be destroyed!

00:20:39.640 --> 00:20:41.970
But this place holds so 
many memories for him!

00:20:42.210 --> 00:20:44.990
Ikuto, knock it off-nya!

00:20:44.990 --> 00:20:46.440
Ikuto!

00:20:50.600 --> 00:20:52.970
Amu-chan, use the Heart Rod!

00:20:52.970 --> 00:20:53.520
Right!

00:20:59.580 --> 00:21:01.190
What are you doing?

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:02.470
I can't do it.

00:21:02.470 --> 00:21:04.280
I can't attack Ikuto.

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:09.540
Amu-chan!

00:21:09.540 --> 00:21:10.330
But...

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:16.960
Stop! Don't destroy it!

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:17.720
Amu!

00:21:17.720 --> 00:21:18.620
Amu-chan!

00:21:18.620 --> 00:21:19.630
Run!

00:21:42.270 --> 00:21:43.690
Tadase-kun...

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:49.110
In this world, much sorrow comes 
from fighting one another.

00:21:49.760 --> 00:21:52.830
Even though an individual's power might be small...

00:21:53.680 --> 00:21:58.600
If I can make even one 
person's world a happy place...

00:21:58.600 --> 00:22:00.230
If I can begin with that...

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:04.670
Then I... I can become King of my own world!

00:22:31.690 --> 00:22:36.260
Maybe I was wrong to pretend not to notice your worries.

00:22:36.260 --> 00:22:41.070
It's okay if you can't tell me everything.

00:22:41.070 --> 00:22:43.450
With that dark look on your face,

00:22:43.450 --> 00:22:45.690
go ahead and scream dark things.

00:22:45.690 --> 00:22:50.000
You shouldn't leave all those heavy feelings inside.

00:22:50.000 --> 00:22:51.480
Ride On!

00:22:54.870 --> 00:22:57.680
If you don't... If it's like that...

00:22:57.680 --> 00:23:00.600
You couldn't tell me if you wanted to, huh?

00:23:01.860 --> 00:23:04.350
I get it.

00:23:04.350 --> 00:23:07.010
I'm sure your circumstances will change one day.

00:23:07.010 --> 00:23:10.040
That time will come! That time is now!

00:23:13.860 --> 00:23:15.670
Don't you want to have someone

00:23:15.670 --> 00:23:18.300
say congratulations to you once in your life?

00:23:18.300 --> 00:23:23.230
Doesn't the breeze feel nice today?

00:23:23.230 --> 00:23:27.600
Even if you feel like it's all you can do to survive...

00:23:27.600 --> 00:23:32.470
You can make your life into something you enjoy. It's so nice!

00:23:32.470 --> 00:23:37.290
"Everything's for you."

00:23:37.290 --> 00:23:41.890
How about that?

00:23:43.590 --> 00:23:45.040
My boy!

00:23:50.200 --> 00:23:53.530
I sure am glad Amu-chan is feeling better.

00:23:53.530 --> 00:23:55.020
We found Ikuto!

00:23:55.020 --> 00:23:56.870
But now we're in a jam!

00:23:56.870 --> 00:23:59.430
And to make things worse, 
Easter's Director shows up!

00:23:59.430 --> 00:24:01.280
So this is Ikuto's father?

00:24:01.280 --> 00:24:03.290
Ikuto, wake up!

00:24:03.290 --> 00:24:04.960
Don't listen to that guy!

00:24:04.960 --> 00:24:10.300
By the way, you think Tadase-kun 
and Amu-chan will make up?

00:24:10.300 --> 00:24:12.330
Next time on Shugo Chara!! Doki:

00:24:12.330 --> 00:24:14.780
Believe in Each Other! Platinum Heart!

00:24:14.780 --> 00:24:19.080
Ikuto, Tadase-kun... 
I'm not gonna run away anymore!
